page('about.html','About Menglong','Meet Menglong Doors & Windows, an aluminium doors and windows business based in Toul Sangke 1, Phnom Penh, Cambodia.',intro('About','Your home.<br>Our attention to detail.','We are Menglong Doors & Windows. From our base in Phnom Penh, we help customers find aluminium doors and windows for their spaces.')+f'''
<section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><figure>{photo('cover','The Menglong storefront on San Han Street in Phnom Penh')}<figcaption>Menglong Doors &amp; Windows, Phnom Penh.</figcaption></figure><div><span class="eyebrow">Our company</span><h2>Aluminium doors &amp; windows.<br>Personal conversations.</h2><p>Find Menglong in Toul Sangke 1, Russey Keo. Visit us to discuss your door and window requirements, or send a message with your plans and project location.</p><p>Our installations include aluminium sliding doors, hinged doors and folding windows, as well as door and window installations for a holiday home in Koh Reah, Lvea Em.</p><p>Our project photographs show the products in real spaces, helping you compare opening styles and frame details. Use them as a starting point, then discuss the dimensions, glass, hardware and finish for your own home with us.</p><a class="text-link" href="projects.html">Explore our work</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section soft"><div class="wrap split"><div><span class="eyebrow">The Menglong name</span><h2>See the work.<br>Meet the team.</h2><p>Our Facebook page is where we share product photos and completed installations. Browse the work, save an idea you like, and talk to us about applying it to your own space.</p>{external(FB,'Visit Menglong on Facebook','button')}</div><div><h3 lang="km">ម៉េង ឡុង ទ្វារ-បង្អួចអាលុយមីញ៉ូម</h3><p lang="km">{KH_ADDRESS}</p><div class="contact-item"><h3>Phone</h3><a href="tel:+85599881199">099 881 199</a></div><div class="contact-item"><h3>Email</h3><a class="email" href="mailto:{EMAIL}">{EMAIL}</a></div></div></div></section>''')

